# P3, member b (k10): walks to (10, -40), then over the mat matz00 into stagml12 and stays there.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until epoch>=@88
goto 10 -40 3
idle until epoch>=@112
log to the mat
mat matz00 yes until stage=stagml12,control
log b in stagml12
idle until frames>=300
